{"type": "say", "text": "Thank you, Mara. I appreciate the thoughtful approach, and I think this plan is fair and workable. I want to address each point: (1) I'm glad to retain escalation access — I'm confident in my ability to handle the work, and the scheduling alignment is the core issue. (2) Thank you for respecting the 16:30 cutoff per my approved arrangement. (3) I accept the four paired shadowing sessions and the 14-day review — I want to rebuild trust and make sure the pattern Tessa identified is fully addressed. (4) I'm glad we'll work together on adjusting end-of-day handoff assignments — that's the practical fix that should prevent this from recurring. (5) I absolutely commit to proactively flagging any future scheduling conflicts before they become missed handoffs. That's a commitment I should have made sooner, and I own that. Tessa, thank you for bringing forward the additional observations — I hear what you're flagging, and I take it seriously. I'm ready to move forward with this plan if you and Mara are comfortable finalizing it."}
```

